---
description: "API routers for FastAPI."
globs:
  - "app/api/**/*.py"
alwaysApply: false
---

Follow root `AGENTS.md`.

When editing routers:

- Keep FastAPI routers thin; put domain logic in `app/services/`.
- Use Pydantic v2 models for request and response bodies.
- Prefer dependency injection for db/session and settings.
- Do not put business rules inline in route functions.
